// Gold set for the harvested gallery corpus (studio/knowledge/gallery_prompts.jsonl).
// The corpus itself is NOT in this repository; see docs/SELFRAG.md.
//
// Ground truth is `must_category`: the gallery's own section label. A query
// passes when the retriever returns at least one record filed under that
// section. The grouping is a third party's, not ours, which is what keeps the
// measurement from being circular — the alternative, judging against records
// we picked ourselves, measures our own taste.
//
// Every query below is written from scratch in English. No prompt wording from
// the corpus is reproduced here. The section labels are labels, not content,
// and are kept for the reason NOTICE_replacement.md already gives.
